  "Off": "Kucimile",
  "Off, your own background is left out of it: the theme keeps its own colours while the picture is up, and only moves when a title's artwork covers it.": "Uma kucimile, isizinda sakho asifakwa kulokhu: itimu igcina imibala yayo ngenkathi isithombe sibonakala, futhi ishintsha kuphela uma izithombe zesihloko zisimboza.",
  "Offline": "TODO_TRANSLATION: Offline",
