  "The project does not host, run, endorse or recommend any source, and does not distribute a list of them.": "Le phrojekthi ayibambi, ayiqhubi, ayivumeli futhi ayincomi noma yimuphi umthombo, futhi ayisabalalisi uhlu lwayo.",
