  "The torrent stream isn't ready yet (engine replied HTTP {status}). It may still be fetching metadata from peers.": "Ukusakaza kwe-torrent akukalungeli (injini iphendule nge-HTTP {status}). Kungenzeka isathola imethadatha kontanga.",
  "The update couldn't be installed: {error}": "Isibuyekezo asikwazanga ukufakwa: {error}",
  "Theme": "Itimu",
  "There is barely room for one film here. Plug a USB drive into the box — formatted FAT32, which every Android box accepts — and it appears above to download onto instead.": "Lapha kunendawo eyanele ifilimu elilodwa nje. Faka idrayivu ye-USB ebhokisini — efomethwe nge-FAT32, wonke amabhokisi e-Android ayayamukela — bese ivela ngenhla ukuze ulande kuyo esikhundleni salokho.",
  "There is no account to sign in to and nothing syncs to a server. What you watch, how far you got, your favourites and your watchlist are all stored on this device and never leave it. Syncing between screens is planned; until then, the backup below is how a library moves.": "Ayikho i-akhawunti ongangena kuyo futhi akukho okuvumelaniswa neseva. Okubukayo, ukuthi ufinyelele kuphi, izintandokazi zakho nohlu lwakho lokubuka — konke kugcinwa kule divayisi futhi akuphumi kuyo. Ukuvumelanisa phakathi kwezikrini kuhleliwe; kuze kube yileso sikhathi, isipele esingezansi yindlela umtapo othuthelwa ngayo.",
  "There's no {file} in your documents folder. Copy one there and try again.": "Alikho i-{file} efoldeni yakho yamadokhumenti. Kopisha elilodwa lapho bese uzama futhi.",
